==English==

===Etymology===
* {{suffix|pathology|ical}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Pertaining to [[pathology]].
# Relating to or caused by a physical or mental disorder.
# {{context|mathematics|lang=en}} Having properties which are [[counterintuitive]] or difficult to handle.
# {{context|computer science|lang=en}} Having properties that cause unusually bad behaviour, especially regarding correctness or performance.

====Synonyms====
* [[pathologic]]

====Antonyms====
* {{sense|mathematics}} {{soplink|well|-|behaved}}

====Derived terms====
* [[pathologically]]

